          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yerobowamu, ibijanye n’ukuntu yakomeje igisoda ciwe, intambara yagwanye, n’ingene yagarukanye ibisagara vya Damasiko na Hamati kuri Isirayeli, ibisagara vyari vyarigaruriwe na Yuda, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowamu arahava ahamvya ba sekuruza, ari bo bami ba Isirayeli. Umuhungu wiwe Zakariya aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
